<title>NETHERLANDS: Fugro to buy some Oceanics assets.</title>
<headline>Fugro to buy some Oceanics assets.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fugro NV said on Wednesday it would buy the worldwide offshore survey and satellite location-finding activities of Oceanics Group PLC.</p>
<p>Fugro said it would pay 6.1 million stg of goodwill plus the value of the assets on December 31, 1996, which it did not put a price on.</p>
</text>
